Moves an install from the old `t3` command to `tscircuit-desktop`. Builds up to 0.1.3 linked the command as `t3`, the name of T3 Code's own command. At startup the old link and launcher are removed when they are this app's (src/tscircuit/legacyT3Command.ts), and an install that had the command gets it back under the new name.

